<title>USA: Authentic Fitness sees no loss from floods.</title>
<headline>Authentic Fitness sees no loss from floods.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Authentic Fitness Corp on Monday said its quarterly earnings will be unaffected by recent heavy rains and flooding in Nevada which forced the temporary closing of one of its distribution centers.</p>
<p>Distribution of products, which include fitness clothes, swimwear and accessories, is being conducted at Authentic Fitness's other centers, and insurance will cover operations at the Nevada facility, the company said in a statement.</p>
